I would like to plot branches by bootstrap values, change the title of the legend and then plot the tips by groups.

This successfully plot the tree using bootstrap values with legend title -> bs
q<-ggtree(tpre, aes(color=bs))+scale_colour_continuous(high="black", low='lightblue')+ theme(legend.position = "bottom")

I have tried  but get legend.title, legend.text etc... but get error in element text or theme....
ggtree(midpoint.root(tpre), aes(color=bs))+scale_color_continuous(high="black", low='lightblue')+ theme(legend.position = "bottom", title=element_text("bootstrap value", size=1, font="arial"))

However when I try and combine the 2.

q %<+% d + geom_tippoint(aes(color=as.factor(clusterID)), size=1)+scale_color_manual(values=c('1'="red", '2'="yellow"))

