The problem here is that you are trying to mapping two variable to color, and their will be appended as ggplot2 don’t allow you to have two color aes mapping. So you need to provide all the manual selected colors to scale_color_continuous instead of two separated sets.

see an example in https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/ggtree/issues/78#issuecomment-252172314.

