Never mind, I figured out how to add them using a loop (below if anyone is interested):

mytree <- treedata
for(row in c(1:nrow(linklist))){
  mytree <- mytree + geom_taxalink(linklist$taxa1[row],linklist$taxa2[row],color='red')
}
mytree

