This is due to your file lack of dNdS information. Now I updated the source code to compatible with such file:
> require(treeio)
Loading required package: treeio
> x = read.codeml_mlc("~/Downloads/out")
no dNdS information found...
> x
'codeml_mlc' S4 object that stored information of
     '~/Downloads/out'.

...@ tree:
Phylogenetic tree with 16 tips and 14 internal nodes.

Tip labels:
    Ictidomys|NM_001282255, Marmota|XM_015503335, Ochotona|XM_004599211, Dipodomys|XM_013021025, Mus|NP_032412, Rattus|NP_062002, ...
Node labels:
    17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, ...

Unrooted; includes branch lengths.

with the following features available:
    ''.

You need to upgrade treeio using:
devtools::install_github("guangchuangyu/treeio")
​

